  "details": "Description\n\nfor about a month and a half now vrchat has been insanely slow, like the menus take a crazy time to load, and avatars can take minutes stuck 'fetching metadata', and a lot of the time the menu doesnt update at all, it says people who got off an hour ago are still on or in a different world whennim in the new world with them, the entire social section barely updates evrr unless i close the game and reopen it. my wifi and pc are top tier, andni clear my caches daily but this all happens every time i get on.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nim genuinely unsure why this is happening to my game. i didnt do anything different it just randomly started doing this\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-24_18-43-20.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_cf3bf361-d7c0-4664-81fe-7d6252de0c2b/1/file)",
